S("S003","The dimension in D004 is a supremum in the nonnegative extended reals, so it is nonnegative, including for the empty set. The arbitrary choices of m,A,s and F001-F002 prove every clause of N001.",[],["m","A","s","dim_H","H","μH"],["F001","F002"])
],applications:[
App("M001","S001","X=Euclidean R^m, measurable structure=borel(R^m), a=s, source set=A.",["Euclidean R^m is a metric space, hence an extended metric space by its finite distance.","The explicitly chosen measurable structure is exactly the Borel structure."]),
